              >Case studies</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px; width:96px;"
          >
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"
              ><path d="M4 9h15l4 4h21v27H4z" fill="#2fb07b"></path><path
                d="M4 16h40v24H4z"
                fill="#54e0a6"></path><path d="M4 16h40v2H4z" fill="#8af0c4"
              ></path><g transform="translate(14 17) scale(0.84)"
                ><path
                  d="M9 8l-4 4 4 4M15 8l4 4-4 4M13 6l-2 12"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#0a1626"
                  stroke-opacity=".62"
                  stroke-width="2.1"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g
              ></svg
            >
            <span
              style="font-size:12px; font-weight:500; text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.9);"
              >Side projects</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px; width:96px;"
          >
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"
              ><path d="M4 9h15l4 4h21v27H4z" fill="#2fb07b"></path><path
                d="M4 16h40v24H4z"
                fill="#54e0a6"></path><path d="M4 16h40v2H4z" fill="#8af0c4"
              ></path><g transform="translate(14 17) scale(0.84)"
                ><path
                  d="M5 19l1-4L15.5 5.5a2 2 0 0 1 3 3L9 18zM14 7l3 3"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#0a1626"
                  stroke-opacity=".62"
                  stroke-width="2.1"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g
              ></svg
            >
            <span
              style="font-size:12px; font-weight:500; text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.9);"
              >Essays</span
